        {
          "text": "Atu ariosala, yani alavyadzi-sadaka, Alawi, arindzi a maryango, aimbadzi, atumishi a nyumba ya kuvoya Mlungu na atu osi ariodzitenga na atu a tsi jirani kpwa sababu ya yo shariya ya Mlungu, phamwenga na achetu aho na ana aho osi ambao kala akafika umuri wa kuelewa mambo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
