          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Swiswi alavyadzi-sadaka, Alawi na nyo atu hukapiga kura ili humanye ni wakati wani ambao chila nyumba indareha kuni za kuochera sadaka kpwenye phatu pha kulavira sadaka pha Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu kahi za wakati urioikpwa chila mwaka kama shariya iambavyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.10.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.10.34"
            ]
          }
        },
