                  "text": "Kutsama 13:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona kama irivyoandikpwa kpwenye chitabu cha shariya, hundareha ana ehu a kpwandza alume na ana a kpwandza a mifugo yehu kpwenye nyumba ya Mlungu wehu, kpwa alavyadzi-sadaka anaohumika mumo.",
          "type": "text",
